# Sights

- Parallel SKU at `/sights/*` — composes research, GCI, citations, Radar hooks.
- **Cite-only or refuse**; never invent actuals or filings.
- **Never:** competitor trademarks in UI, unlicensed broker PDF proxy, expert-call marketplace, Buy/Hold.
- Backend: `backend/app/services/sights.py` · APIs: `/api/sights/*`.
- Feature flags: `SIGHTS`, `SIGHTS_DEEP_DIVE`, `SIGHTS_GRID`, `SIGHTS_AGENTS`, `SIGHTS_WEB_ASSIST` (off by default).
- Entitlements: plan ∩ role; `sights_ask` for Ask/chat surfaces (`entitlements.py`).
- Cite Research Terminal stays at `/research` (Cite SKU) — do not merge routes.
- KB: `docs/kb/14-sights.md` · customer: `docs/customer/skus/SIGHTS.md`.
